                <div style="width:100%; height:110px; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:#182320; border:1.5px solid rgba(56,201,178,0.4); position:relative;" id="reportPhotoBoxRight">
                  <img id="reportPhotoImgRight" src="" alt="우측면" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:none;">
                  <div id="reportPhotoPlaceholderRight" style="width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#5f7c76; font-size:11px; font-weight:700;">
                    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="3"/><path d="M9 20l3-7 3 7"/><path d="M6 12h12"/></svg>
                    <span style="margin-top:4px;">우측면</span>
                  </div>
                  <span style="position:absolute; bottom:4px; right:4px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.65); color:#38c9b2; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 5px; border-radius:6px;">대칭 98%</span>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:var(--text-main);">우측면</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-card">
            <h4 style="font-size:15px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:14px;">신체 부위별 황금 밸런스</h4>
            <div class="dim-row">
              <div class="dim-meta"><span>어깨 너비 vs 골반 비율</span><span style="color:var(--primary-mint-dark);">1 : 0.98 (완벽 밸런스)</span></div>
              <div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-bar" style="width:88%;"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-row">
              <div class="dim-meta"><span>목 길이 &amp; 쇄골 각도</span><span style="color:var(--primary-mint-dark);">표준 입체형</span></div>
              <div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-bar" style="width:75%;"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-row">
              <div class="dim-meta"><span>상체 길이 vs 하체 비율</span><span style="color:var(--primary-mint-dark);">48% : 52% (롱레그)</span></div>
              <div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-bar" style="width:82%;"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-row">
              <div class="dim-meta"><span>허리-힙 곡선 굴곡도</span><span style="color:var(--primary-mint-dark);">0.72 (탄력 S라인)</span></div>
              <div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-bar" style="width:92%;"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="info-card">
            <h4 style="font-size:15px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:10px;">소재 및 네크라인 매칭</h4>
            <div style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-sub); display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;">
              <p>✔ <strong>추천 소재:</strong> 고밀도 코튼, 울 100%, 실크 새틴, 탄탄한 레더</p>
              <p>✔ <strong>추천 넥라인:</strong> V넥, 오픈 카라, 스퀘어넥</p>
              <p>✔ <strong>기장 팁:</strong> 골반에 걸치는 스탠다드 상의 &amp; 스트레이트 팬츠</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button class="btn-secondary" id="btnRetakePhoto">체형 재측정 (사진 재촬영)</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ========================================================
           [Step 7-2] 부가서비스: 체형/자세 교정 화면
           ======================================================== -->
      <section class="screen" id="screen-posture">
        <header class="nav-header">
          <button class="btn-back" id="btnBackFromPosture" aria-label="뒤로가기">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <span class="header-title">맞춤 자세 &amp; 체형 교정</span>
          <div style="width:36px;"></div>
        </header>

        <div class="sub-page-body">
          <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e3f8f4,#c7f3eb); padding:18px; border-radius:var(--radius-lg);">
            <h3 style="font-size:17px; font-weight:800; color:var(--text-main);">매일 5분 바른 정렬 루틴</h3>
            <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-sub); margin-top:4px;">굽은 어깨와 골반 밸런스를 개선하여 슬림한 옷태를 완성합니다.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="routine-box">
            <div class="routine-icon" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e3f8f4,#ccf5ed); border:1px solid rgba(56,201,178,0.4);">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary-mint-dark)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <!-- 어깨 & 쇄골 실루엣 아이콘 (첨부 어깨 이미지 반영) -->
                <!-- 우측 목 및 몸통 외곽 수직/수평 프레임 -->
                <path d="M22 2v20H9l-1.5-3.5"/>
                <!-- 목 좌측선에서 둥근 어깨 및 상완으로 내려가는 메인 곡선 -->
                <path d="M15 2v9c0 .8-.5 1.4-1.2 1.7-4 1.5-8.5 3.8-9.8 9.3"/>
                <!-- 흉쇄유돌근 사선 라인 -->
                <line x1="17" y1="4.5" x2="19" y2="9.5"/>
                <!-- 쇄골(빗장뼈) 라인 -->
                <path d="M12.5 13.5l4.5 1 2 2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1;">
              <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700;">라운드숄더 펴기 &amp; 쇄골 열기</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-sub);">벽 대고 W자 팔 벌리기 (30초)</div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-primary btn-timer-trigger" data-sec="30" style="width:60px; height:36px; font-size:12px;">시작</button>
          </div>

          <div class="routine-box">
            <div class="routine-icon" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef7ff,#d7ecff); border:1px solid rgba(43,127,255,0.3);">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#256fe6" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <!-- 골반 & 척추 뼈대 아이콘 (첨부 골반 이미지 반영) -->
                <!-- 상단 척추(요추) 3마디 분절 -->
                <path d="M10 3.2c.8-.7 3.2-.7 4 0-.8.7-3.2.7-4 0z"/>
                <path d="M10 5.8c.8-.7 3.2-.7 4 0-.8.7-3.2.7-4 0z"/>
                <path d="M10 8.4c.8-.7 3.2-.7 4 0-.8.7-3.2.7-4 0z"/>
                <!-- 나비/하트 형태의 골반뼈(장골대) 프레임 -->
                <path d="M12 12.8c-1.8-1.5-4-1.5-5 0-1.5 1.8-.8 4.6 2 5.6 1.4.5 2.2-.2 3-.8.8.6 1.6 1.3 3 .8 2.8-1 3.5-3.8 2-5.6-1-1.5-3.2-1.5-5 0z"/>
                <!-- 좌우 대퇴골(고관절 소켓과 다리 연결 뼈대) -->
                <path d="M6 14.5c-1 1.5-1.5 3.8-1 6.5"/>
                <path d="M8 16c-.3 1.8-.3 3.5 0 5"/>
                <path d="M18 14.5c1 1.5 1.5 3.8 1 6.5"/>
                <path d="M16 16c.3 1.8.3 3.5 0 5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1;">
              <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700;">골반 전방경사 교정 브릿지</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-sub);">골반 수평 정렬 운동 (45초)</div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-primary btn-timer-trigger" data-sec="45" style="width:60px; height:36px; font-size:12px;">시작</button>
          </div>

          <div class="routine-box">
            <div class="routine-icon" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fbf2ff,#eed9ff); border:1px solid rgba(170,80,250,0.3);">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8e3bd9" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <!-- 목 & 승모근 파동 릴리즈 아이콘 (첨부 목 이미지 반영) -->
                <!-- 고개 숙인 측면 두경부 및 승모근/등 실루엣 -->
                <path d="M6.5 12c-1-.5-1.5-1.8-1.5-2.8 0-1.5.5-3 1.5-4.8C8 2.4 10.8 2 12.2 3.8c1.5 2 2.4 4.2 3.4 6.8 1.4 3.4 1.8 6.4 2.2 10.4"/>
                <!-- 턱 아래 목선 및 앞가슴 라인 -->
                <path d="M6.5 12c1.2.6 2.5.4 3-.6.5-1 0 1.2-1.5 9.6"/>
                <!-- 팔/어깨 구분 라인 -->
                <path d="M11.8 21c.5-3.8 1.8-5.6 3.2-5.2 1.4.4 1.5 2 1.8 5.2"/>
                <!-- 뒷목/승모근 통증 및 릴리즈 방사형 웨이브 3선 -->
                <path d="M15.5 11.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 1 2.8-1.2"/>
                <path d="M15.5 9.2a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 4.5-1.2"/>
                <path d="M15.5 7.2a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 6.2-1.2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1;">
              <div style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700;">목선을 살리는 승모근 릴리즈</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-sub);">목 측면 부드럽게 당기기 (30초)</div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-primary btn-timer-trigger" data-sec="30" style="width:60px; height:36px; font-size:12px;">시작</button>
          </div>

          <!-- 유튜브 쇼츠 추천 영상 카드 -->
          <div style="margin-top:8px; border-radius:var(--radius-lg); overflow:hidden; border:1.5px solid var(--border-mint); background:var(--white); box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(32,181,159,0.10);">
            <!-- 카드 헤더 -->
            <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:12px 14px 10px 14px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e3f8f4,#f0fbf8);">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#ff0000">
                <path d="M23.5 6.2a3 3 0 0 0-2.1-2.1C19.5 3.6 12 3.6 12 3.6s-7.5 0-9.4.5A3 3 0 0 0 .5 6.2 31 31 0 0 0 0 12a31 31 0 0 0 .5 5.8 3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.1C4.5 20.4 12 20.4 12 20.4s7.5 0 9.4-.5a3 3 0 0 0 2.1-2.1A31 31 0 0 0 24 12a31 31 0 0 0-.5-5.8z"/>
                <polygon points="9.6,15.6 15.9,12 9.6,8.4" fill="white"/>
              </svg>
              <span style="font-size:13px; font-weight:800; color:var(--text-main);">추천 체형 교정 영상</span>
              <span style="margin-left:auto; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:#ff0000; background:#fff0f0; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px;">YouTube Shorts</span>
            </div>
            <!-- 썸네일 + 정보 -->
            <a href="https://youtube.com/shorts/ye8pe1j5OeQ?si=QA6bj5JIX7c60Mgc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
               style="display:flex; gap:12px; padding:12px 14px; text-decoration:none; align-items:flex-start;">
              <!-- 썸네일 -->
              <div style="position:relative; flex-shrink:0; width:88px; height:88px; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:#1a1a2e;">
                <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ye8pe1j5OeQ/hqdefault.jpg"
                     onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
                     alt="유튜브 쇼츠 썸네일"
                     style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;">
                <!-- 썸네일 로드 실패 시 대체 -->
                <div style="display:none; width:100%; height:100%; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#20b59f,#179b88); border-radius:12px;">
                  <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white"><polygon points="5,3 19,12 5,21"/></svg>
                </div>
                <!-- 재생 버튼 오버레이 -->
                <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.25);">
                  <div style="width:28px; height:28px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
                    <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="#20b59f"><polygon points="2,1 11,6 2,11"/></svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- 텍스트 정보 -->
              <div style="flex:1; min-width:0;">
                <div style="font-size:13.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--text-main); line-height:1.4; margin-bottom:5px;">체형 교정 루틴 쇼츠</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-sub); line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:8px;">체형별 맞춤 자세 교정 운동을 영상으로 확인해 보세요.</div>
                <div style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--primary-mint-dark); background:var(--primary-mint-soft); padding:4px 10px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--border-mint);">
                  <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
                  영상 보러가기
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ========================================================
           [Step 7-3] SHOP: 무신사 & 에이블리 체형 맞춤 셀렉트숍
           ======================================================== -->
      <section class="screen" id="screen-styling">
        <header class="nav-header">
          <button class="btn-back" id="btnBackFromStyling" aria-label="뒤로가기">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          </button>
          <span class="header-title">SHOP (무신사 &amp; 에이블리)</span>
          <div style="width:36px;"></div>
        </header>

        <div class="sub-page-body" style="padding-top:12px;">
          <!-- 체형 안내 바 -->
          <div style="background:var(--primary-mint-soft); border:1px solid var(--border-mint); padding:10px 14px; border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
            <div style="font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--text-main);">
              내 체형: <span style="color:var(--primary-mint-dark); font-weight:800;" id="shopBodyTypeBadge">스트레이트형</span> 맞춤 셀렉트
            </div>
            <span style="font-size:11px; background:var(--white); padding:3px 8px; border-radius:12px; color:var(--text-sub); border:1px solid var(--border-light);">실제 쇼핑몰 연동</span>
          </div>

          <!-- 쇼핑몰 필터 탭 -->
          <div class="chip-scroll">
            <button class="filter-chip active" data-mall-filter="all">전체 상품</button>
            <button class="filter-chip" data-mall-filter="musinsa">🖤 무신사 (MUSINSA)</button>
            <button class="filter-chip" data-mall-filter="ably">💖 에이블리 (A-BLY)</button>
            <button class="filter-chip" data-mall-filter="myfit">🎯 내 체형 맞춤</button>
          </div>

          <!-- 카테고리 필터 -->
          <div style="display:flex; gap:6px; overflow-x:auto; scrollbar-width:none; padding-bottom:2px;">
            <button class="category-chip active" data-cat-filter="all" style="padding:5px 12px; border-radius:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; border:1px solid var(--border-light); background:var(--white); color:var(--text-main); cursor:pointer;">전체</button>
            <button class="category-chip" data-cat-filter="top" style="padding:5px 12px; border-radius:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid var(--border-light); background:var(--white); color:var(--text-sub); cursor:pointer;">아우터/상의</button>
            <button class="category-chip" data-cat-filter="bottom" style="padding:5px 12px; border-radius:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid var(--border-light); background:var(--white); color:var(--text-sub); cursor:pointer;">팬츠/하의</button>
            <button class="category-chip" data-cat-filter="onepiece" style="padding:5px 12px; border-radius:14px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid var(--border-light); background:var(--white); color:var(--text-sub); cursor:pointer;">원피스/스커트</button>
          </div>

          <!-- 무신사 & 에이블리 2열 상품 그리드 (실제 의류 화보/상품 사진 연동) -->
          <div class="shop-products-grid" id="shopProductsGrid">
            <!-- 1. 무신사 블레이저 -->
            <div class="shop-card outlink-product" data-url="https://www.musinsa.com/products/2081554" data-mall="무신사" data-cat="top" data-fit="스트레이트" data-name="무신사 스탠다드 릴렉스드 베이직 블레이저">
              <div class="shop-card-img-wrap">
                <span class="badge-mall badge-musinsa shop-card-badge">MUSINSA</span>
                <button class="btn-card-wish" title="찜하기">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
                </button>
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591047139829-d91aecb6caea?w=500&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="무신사 스탠다드 블레이저" loading="lazy">
              </div>
              <div class="shop-card-body">
                <span class="shop-card-match">🎯 스트레이트 99%</span>
                <div class="shop-card-brand">MUSINSA STANDARD</div>
                <div class="shop-card-title">릴렉스드 베이직 블레이저 (블랙)</div>
                <div class="shop-card-price-row">
                  <span class="shop-card-discount">11%</span>
                  <span class="shop-card-price">₩79,900</span>
                </div>
                <button class="btn-shop-outlink btn-shop-musinsa">
                  <span>무신사 구매 페이지 ↗</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. 에이블리 크롭 가디건 -->
            <div class="shop-card outlink-product" data-url="https://m.a-bly.com/goods/18491823" data-mall="에이블리" data-cat="top" data-fit="웨이브" data-name="슬림 골지 크롭 브이넥 니트 가디건">
              <div class="shop-card-img-wrap">
                <span class="badge-mall badge-ably shop-card-badge">A-BLY</span>
                <button class="btn-card-wish" title="찜하기">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
                </button>
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620799140408-edc6dcb6d633?w=500&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="슬림 골지 크롭 가디건" loading="lazy">
              </div>
              <div class="shop-card-body">
                <span class="shop-card-match">🎯 웨이브 98%</span>
                <div class="shop-card-brand">에이블리 셀렉트</div>
                <div class="shop-card-title">슬림 골지 크롭 브이넥 가디건</div>
                <div class="shop-card-price-row">
                  <span class="shop-card-discount">29%</span>
                  <span class="shop-card-price">₩19,800</span>
                </div>
                <button class="btn-shop-outlink btn-shop-ably">
                  <span>에이블리 구매 페이지 ↗</span>
                </button>
